{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-nobles-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"nobles-tower-tiger-group-business-bay","about":"Nobles Tower - a modern residential complex from the developer Tiger Group, located in the heart of Dubai - in the Business Bay area. The tower rises above the city on 50 floors, among which 5 floors are allocated for covered parking, and on 45 floors there are elegant apartments with 1-3 bedrooms with fantastic views of the city and the seafront of Business Bay. All residences are adorned with modern and sophisticated finishes with both aesthetics and practicality in mind.Among the amenities of the complex are a gym with state-of-the-art equipment, a large swimming pool and jogging and walking paths with a total length of 83 meters. There are cafes, restaurants, supermarkets and stores within walking distance of the complex.Business Bay is the epicenter of business activity in the city. Residents of the complex can enjoy easy access to city facilities as well as the main thoroughfares of the city, making it quick and convenient to get around the city.Nobles Tower offers the highest level of luxury, comfort and convenience combined with a vibrant and dynamic neighborhood atmosphere. This development is ideal for those seeking the benefits of a modern urban lifestyle and a high degree of comfort.","price":2190000,"title":"Nobles Tower","bitrix":{"id":473,"pf_id":"are.2.11307","source":null,"project_id":"Nobles Tower","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Nobles Tower","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Tiger Group","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/136/images/2023/07/27/340x252/PHLMkbHFijfNDPSvCoSqoKF8XjXERifGEFkbbFCm.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/136/images/2023/07/27/464x312/PHLMkbHFijfNDPSvCoSqoKF8XjXERifGEFkbbFCm.webp"}],"status":